# Frontend Rules

Next.js, React, TypeScript, Tailwind, React Hook Form, Zod and TanStack Query.
Keep server communication in API/client modules.
Do not put authorization decisions only in the UI.
Validate forms and present accessible errors.
Keep business rules on the backend; frontend validation is for UX.
